No monster will loot a box or chest.  But gelatinous cubes will eat
boxes or chests and digest the container.  After the container is
gone they begin to digest the contents.  So every time you arrive
on your stash level, check that all of the boxes are there and if
any are missing track down any blobs on the level immediately.
Note that no monster moves on a level unless you are on it, so
there is no exposure to this risk until you get back there.

